Exp :Substring of a string

Aim:
To write a Java program to find a substring from a given string using the substring() method.

Algorithm:
1. Start the program.
2. Import the Scanner package.
3. Read a string from the user.
4. Read the starting and ending indexes.
5. Use the substring() method to extract the substring.
6. Display the substring.
7. Stop the program.

Program:

import java.util.Scanner;
public class SubstringExample {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        String str;
        int start, end;

        System.out.print("Enter a string: ");
        str = sc.nextLine();

        System.out.print("Enter starting index: ");
        start = sc.nextInt();

        System.out.print("Enter ending index: ");
        end = sc.nextInt();

        if (start >= 0 && start < end && end <= str.length()) {
            System.out.println("Substring = " +
                               str.substring(start, end));
        } else {
            System.out.println("Invalid indexes");
        }

        sc.close();
    }
}


